  "summary": "Surgical revenue grew 17%; total revenue grew 14% Company announces refinancing of existing debt with inaugural bank facility, reducing interest expense by more than $6 million annually and extending maturities to 2031 Alphatec Holdings, Inc. (Nasdaq: ATEC), a spine-focused provider of innovative solutions dedicated to revolutionizing the approach to spine surgery, today announced financial results for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, and business highlights. First Quarter 2026 Financial Result",
